    "content": "`X = A AND (B OR C)`",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: dry soil is needed in every case, together with night or a full tank."
   },
   {
    "key": "B",
    "content": "`X = (A AND B) OR C`",
    "rationale": "This opens the valve whenever the tank is full, even if the soil is wet."
   },
   {
    "key": "C",
    "content": "`X = A OR (B AND C)`",
    "rationale": "This opens the valve whenever the soil is dry, at any time."
   },
   {
    "key": "D",
    "content": "`X = A AND B AND C`",
    "rationale": "This needs night and a full tank together, but either one is enough."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "A must always be 1, so A is ANDed with the group (B OR C): X = A AND (B OR C), output 00000111.",
  "hints": [
